      exampleInfo: !<string[]>
        - "Flat color and texture with no lighting: the cheapest look, good for UI-like props."
        - "Base texture (here lava) with optional rim, opacity and scrolling switches."
        - "One graph combining base texture, emissive, rim, recolor and matcap. Walk around it."
        - "Cel shading: a hard edge between the lit side and the shadow side."
        - "Baked lighting from a matcap texture: the reflection follows your view."
        - Screen-blended glow on the edges of the sphere. Move sideways to see it follow you.
        - Screen-blended glow that fades toward the edge. Shows best on dark backgrounds.
